      <title>Israel Elections: Peace With Palestinians Should Be a Priority</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-06/israel-elections-peace-with-palestinians-should-be-a-priority</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">a6a230eecc5a8e65a4bc9f3a</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 11:00:35 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>With coalition-haggling just getting underway, it may be days or weeks before the shape of Israel’s next government becomes clear. But one thing is already obvious: Peace with the Palestinians won’t be its priority. The US and its partners shouldn’t let it become an afterthought.</description>
